scene W: The grant is public money, and the case for it must be made to the whole town, fairly.
scene U: Numbers will move this council more than feelings: visitors, classes, money spent in town.
scene B: Five minutes at that microphone could make {N} the one the town thinks of when it thinks of art.
scene R: {N} is angry about the cut, and the anger might be the best thing to bring into that room.
scene G: {place} has stood for forty years; it is part of what this town is.
