- U | agree, and bring the figures on visitors, classes and money spent in town | v: achievement, universalism | lever: voice | foot: lesson numbers open closed minds | chance: 70
- B | agree, and line up an interview with the local paper beforehand | v: power, achievement | lever: lead | lead: favours | foot: person go-between | chance: 65
