scene: The board of {place} meets to choose next season. The money is tight, the audience is getting older, and three proposals are on the table. Everyone at the long table turns to {N} before the vote.
- G | the old favourites the town loves, done well | v: tradition, security | scope: place | lever: loyalty | chance: 80
