- B>R | one big touring show that sells out, to pay for wilder work after | v: achievement, stimulation | scope: place | lever: fund | chance: 65
- R | stage the wild new work, billed as the old favourite so the grant still comes | v: stimulation, self-direction | scope: place | lever: subvert | chance: 55
works: The season sells better than the last, and people talk about one of its nights for years.
works: The board agrees it chose well, and the theatre goes into the winter with money in the bank.
