earth: the town has the money for one great mural on the market wall, and {N} has been asked to decide how it is chosen
scene: The long blank wall over the market has been grey for decades, and now there is money for a mural. The council has asked {N}, the best-known artist at {place}, to decide how it will be chosen and who will paint it.
