- B | shape it into a story the whole country will want to buy | v: achievement, power | scope: town_sphere | lever: lead | chance: 60
- R>G | write the town's old ways as a love song, so they are not forgotten | v: benevolence, tradition | scope: town_sphere | lever: loyalty | chance: 65
works: The book is read far beyond the town, and people write to {N} to say it changed how they see their own towns.
works: The town recognises itself in the book, and the library cannot keep copies on the shelf.
fails: The book is quietly reviewed and quickly forgotten, outside the town at least.
fails: Some of the old families feel the book got them wrong, and they say so where {N} can hear.

